  <!-- EN: While originally made in only one region, Tequila has over the thousands of years been made in desert locations on many planets.  It is made from the blue agave plant that has been chopped up, fermented, and then distilled.  Often served with a shot of salt and lime, some varieties also come with a crunch, insectoid snack at the bottom of the bottle. -->
  <RC2_Tequila.description>虽然龙舌兰酒最初只在一个地区生产，但数千年来，许多星球上的沙漠地区都生产过龙舌兰酒。  龙舌兰酒由蓝色龙舌兰植物切碎、发酵后蒸馏而成。  龙舌兰酒通常与盐和酸橙一起饮用，有些品种的龙舌兰酒还会在瓶底放上脆脆的昆虫状小吃。</RC2_Tequila.description>
